# Internal docs — tracked in git (like woodev_theme docs/)
# docs-internal/ — AI agent operational docs (CURRENT-STATE, SESSION-LOG, GOTCHAS, ADR, wiki)

# The handoff is NOT tracked: THIS REPO IS PUBLIC and the file carries operational internals —
# rig URLs, container ids, ports, and how the operator works. Skill rule: woodev-docs-system →
# "The handoff" → Two hard conditions. Operator decision, 25.08.2026.
#
# ⚠ This hides FUTURE versions only. Every handoff pushed before this line is still readable in
# git history and on GitHub; clearing that needs a history rewrite (git filter-repo + force-push),
# which is the operator's call and has not been made.
/docs-internal/next-session-prompt.md
/docs-internal/next-session-prompt.md.prev

# AI tools — do not ignore (reference files required)
!/.ai/
